Spec: Connectivity

Purpose:
  Whether the device is really online, for the offline banner and preview re-rendering.

Owns:
  ./connectivity_observer.dart
  ./connectivity_providers.dart
  /test/core/connectivity_observer_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/05-gps-tracking.md

Must:
  No network or no internet capability means offline.
  Otherwise online means an HTTP probe to `https://clients3.google.com/generate_204` answers `200` to `399`
    within `2.5` s, without redirects or cache.
  It re-checks on every connectivity change and every `10` s, only while observed, and emits only changes.

Must not:
  Trust the operating system's validated flag, which some VPNs fake.
